@Bookings.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150
@machineId = c6441d1c-e21b-4024-b785-d3837d2129a3
@bookingId = 1407afaf-56d5-4ef4-bc66-117c1733f72e
@serviceId = 311ee1a4-5683-4d17-b225-8c7cce5d198d
@customerId = 0c3acd15-08da-4a0d-bab7-3d12eccb7231
@templateId = da7fb875-019b-4af6-ae9c-d45b64f2a7e6
@employeeId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Skapa maskin
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/machines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grävmaskin 5 ton",
  "type": "Grävmaskin",
  "registrationNumber": "abc123",
  "pricePerDay": 1200.00
}

### Hämta alla maskiner
GET {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/machines

### Skapa bokning med maskin
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-07T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-09T16:00:00Z",
  "machines": [
    { "machineId": "{{machineId}}" }
  ]
}

### Skapa tjänst
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/businessservices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Schaktning",
  "description": "Schaktning med maskinförare",
  "pricePerHour": 650.00
}

### Hämta alla tjänster
GET {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/businessservices

### Hämta en tjänst
GET {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/businessservices/{{serviceId}}

### Skapa bokning med maskin och tjänst (priser hämtas från katalogen)
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-11T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-13T16:00:00Z",
  "machines": [
    { "machineId": "{{machineId}}" }
  ],
  "services": [
    { "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}", "estimatedHours": 16 }
  ]
}

### Hämta en bokning
GET {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### Hämta alla bokningar
GET {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings

### Hämta bokningar för en kund
GET {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings?customerId={{customerId}}

### Hämta bokningar för kund som inte har några (ska ge tom lista)
GET {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings?customerId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Uppdatera bokning
PUT {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startsAt": "2026-12-08T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-10T16:00:00Z"
}

### Avboka bokning
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### Ta bort bokning
DELETE {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### Ska ge 400: kortare än 1 dag
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-09T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-07T16:00:00Z",
  "machines": [
    { "machineId": "{{machineId}}" }
  ]
}

### Ska ge 400: maskinen finns inte
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-11T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-13T16:00:00Z",
  "machines": [
    { "machineId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }
  ]
}

### 409-test steg 1: inaktivera tjänsten
PUT {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/businessservices/{{serviceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Schaktning",
  "description": "Schaktning med maskinförare",
  "pricePerHour": 650.00,
  "isActive": false
}

### 409-test steg 2: ska ge 409, tjänsten är inte aktiv
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-11T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-13T16:00:00Z",
  "services": [
    { "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}", "estimatedHours": 8 }
  ]
}

### 409-test steg 3: aktivera tjänsten igen
PUT {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/businessservices/{{serviceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Schaktning",
  "description": "Schaktning med maskinförare",
  "pricePerHour": 650.00,
  "isActive": true
}

### Ska ge 400: längre än 30 dagar
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2027-01-01T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-02-15T16:00:00Z",
  "services": [
    { "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}", "estimatedHours": 8 }
  ]
}

### Ska ge 400: för många timmar (3 dagar × 8 = max 24 timmar)
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2027-01-04T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-01-06T16:00:00Z",
  "services": [
    { "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}", "estimatedHours": 600 }
  ]
}

### Utan endsAt: ska få endsAt = startsAt + 30 dagar
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-01T07:00:00Z",
  "services": [
    { "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}", "estimatedHours": 8 }
  ]
}

### Ska ge 409: maskinen är redan bokad (kör två gånger)
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-08T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-10T16:00:00Z",
  "machines": [
    { "machineId": "{{machineId}}" }
  ]
}

### Avsluta bokning och skicka till Invoices (kräver att Invoices och Customers körs, annars 503)
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateId": "{{templateId}}"
}

### Ska ge 409: bokningen är redan avslutad (kör complete en gång till)
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateId": "{{templateId}}"
}

### Ska ge 400: templateId saknas
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Dubbelbokning anställd steg 1: boka anställd
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2027-02-01T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-02-03T16:00:00Z",
  "employeeIds": [ "{{employeeId}}" ]
}

### Dubbelbokning anställd steg 2: ska ge 409 (överlappar 1–3/2)
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2027-02-02T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-02-04T16:00:00Z",
  "employeeIds": [ "{{employeeId}}" ]
}

### Dubbelbokning anställd steg 3: ska ge 201 (efter 3/2, ingen krock)
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "startsAt": "2027-02-04T07:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2027-02-05T16:00:00Z",
  "employeeIds": [ "{{employeeId}}" ]
}

### Ta uppdrag: ska ge 204
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/services/{{serviceId}}/take
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}"
}

### Ta uppdrag igen: ska ge 409, redan taget
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/services/{{serviceId}}/take
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}"
}

### Ta uppdrag med tjänst som inte finns i bokningen: ska ge 404
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/services/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/take
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}"
}

### Ta uppdrag utan anställd: ska ge 400
POST {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/services/{{serviceId}}/take
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Tjänst kräver titel: sätt RequiredTitle
PUT {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/businessservices/{{serviceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Schaktning",
  "description": "Schaktning med maskinförare",
  "pricePerHour": 650.00,
  "isActive": true,
  "requiredTitle": "ExcavatorOperator"
}

### Lediga uppdrag för grävmaskinist: ska visa bokningar med Schaktning som inte är tagna
GET {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/open?title=ExcavatorOperator

### Lediga uppdrag för chaufför: Schaktning ska INTE synas
GET {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/open?title=Driver

### Lediga uppdrag utan titel: bara tjänster utan titelkrav
GET {{Bookings.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bookings/open